Package: vos-hare
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: lame, vorbis-tools
Description: audio ripper and encoder frontend
 Hare is a front end for ripping and encoding audio: it keeps a list of
 tracks, reads and writes ID3 tags through taglib, and hands the actual
 conversion to encoder add-ons - the Media-based one, M3U playlist
 creation, MP3 GoGo, LAME and Ogg Vorbis (the last two drive the lame and
 oggenc command line tools).
